                    "sense_definition": "An exclamation used to express surprise or emphasis.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "<w>Faith</w>, I did not expect to see you here so soon!",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "<w>Ей-бо́гу</w>, я не ожидал увидеть тебя здесь так скоро!",
                                "tr": "<w>Vallah</w>, seni burada bu kadar çabuk görmeyi beklemiyordum!"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "And <w>faith</w>, it was a difficult journey for all of us.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "И, <w>пра́во</w>, это было трудное путешествие для всех нас.",
                                "tr": "Ve <w>hakikaten</w>, hepimiz için zor bir yolculuktu."
                            }
                        }
